# Plan workdirs are scratch, not protocol. Archive/knowledge must NOT be
# listed here: Cursor Agent Sandbox maps .cursorignore to EPERM, and
# `memory digest` fail-closes if it cannot find(1) archived record names.
# Hide retired trees from search via .cursorindexingignore instead.
zamm-memory/active/plans/**/workdir/**
zamm-memory/archive/plans/**/workdir/**
# SKILL-BLOCK:zamm:END
